Upstream RmlUi pull request #1038 (Jan Niklas Hasse, commit 972f9f9, on 6.3): "Fix exponential layout time
with nested flex containers". Measurements a flex container takes of its items (shrink-to-fit width,
max-content size, formatted height) are cached for one layout pass. Not merged upstream (closed in favour of
the maintainer's unreleased partial_layout_update branch); drop this patch when a release carries either.

